  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Wien's law: $\\lambda_m = \\dfrac{b}{T} = \\dfrac{0.0029}{5 \\times 10^4} = 5.8 \\times 10^{-8}$ m $= 58$ nm.",
